 "rationale": "This grid sets weight.group_size=256 on the GPTQ family to free stored bits, and spends them on layers where the single-layer table shows large drops. model.layers.14.mlp.down_proj: rht_gptq_int2 0.00633466 to rht_gptq_int3 0.00181478. model.layers.2.mlp.up_proj: gptq_int3 0.00641875 to gptq_int4 0.00237045. model.layers.3.mlp.up_proj: rht_gptq_int3 0.0064177 to gptq_int4 0.00237732. model.layers.1.mlp.up_proj: rht_gptq_int3 0.00611131 to rht_gptq_int4 0.00227173. model.layers.27.mlp.up_proj: gptq_int3 0.0057182 to gptq_int4 0.00216589. model.layers.27.mlp.gate_proj: rht_gptq_int3 0.00498703 to rht_gptq_int4 0.00153131. The gate_proj layers of blocks 18 and 11 are also raised from rht_gptq_int2, since both appear in the loss concentration list, but their target KLs were not retrieved. These table values were not measured at this group size, so the whole-recipe measurement must settle the net effect against the base kl=0.43614466651129274.",
